# FinalGrid — repository exclusions
#
# The governing question for every line here is "would committing this
# either leak live data or destroy the signal in the history?"
#
# Note the deliberate INCLUSIONS at the bottom: verification evidence is
# tracked, because Phase 2.6 §13 makes evidence packs release evidence and
# P12 makes them immutable. Untracked evidence is not evidence.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live financial data — must never enter version control
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
instance/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# .env.example IS tracked — it is the documented contract, with no values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Interpreters and dependencies — reproducible from requirements.txt
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
python/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
backups/
uninstall_data/
app/private_uploads/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Verification framework — disposable working area only
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# _work/ holds throwaway copies of the production database. It is
# documented as disposable (verification/README.md), it reaches hundreds of
# megabytes, and each file is a copy of live financial data. Never tracked.
verification/_work/

# Everything else under verification/ IS tracked, explicitly:
#   evidence/    the 81 retained evidence packs      (Phase 2.6 §13)
#   baselines/   named D1 baselines                  (release gate input)
#   masters/     D2 golden master sets               (release gate input)
#   ledgers/     D3 stored replays                   (release gate input)
!verification/evidence/
!verification/baselines/
!verification/masters/
!verification/ledgers/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
